	(text "ESP32-C6-MINI-1 runs ESP-AT or ESP-Hosted firmware as a Wi-Fi 6 / BLE 5\nco-processor. Link: RP2350 UART1 (GPIO20 TX, 21 RX, 22 CTS, 23 RTS)\n<-> ESP UART0 (RXD0/TXD0) + IO6 (RTS) / IO7 (CTS).\nGPIO18 = ESP_EN (drive low to reset), GPIO19 = ESP IO9 strap\n(low at reset = ROM download mode) -> RP2350 can re-flash the ESP\nover the same UART (esp-serial-flasher). IO8 pulled up (required\nfor download mode). ESP native USB on test pads TP1/TP2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110 222 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd89fee8-a1f0-54f0-b702-ead0ad410a02")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
